cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use deslopkit in your research or project, please cite it as below."
title: "deslopkit: A register-aware, fidelity-guarded bilingual de-AI-slop toolkit"
abstract: >-
  deslopkit is a register-aware, fidelity-guarded bilingual (Chinese/English)
  toolkit for reducing templated, machine-like phrasing in text. It ships a
  deterministic rule engine (no LLM required), a Fidelity Guard that verifies
  numbers, proper nouns and quotations are preserved verbatim, register profiles
  for Chinese official/academic/forum and English academic/essay text,
  reproducible metrics with baseline comparison reports, and a CLI plus Agent
  Skill entry point. It does not warrant the output of any third-party detector.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-06"
license: Apache-2.0
license-url: "https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/grantleyzyf-spec/deslopkit"
keywords:
  - text
  - nlp
  - chinese
  - english
  - de-ai-slop
  - register
  - fidelity
  - cli
authors:
